00:40:06,047 --> 00:40:08,316
And from this point on,

755
00:40:08,449 --> 00:40:10,885
this city
and everything in it

756
00:40:11,019 --> 00:40:13,522
belongs to me.

757
00:40:21,996 --> 00:40:24,633
[theme music]

758
00:40:34,075 --> 00:40:35,610
- you'd open the door.
- Seriously?

759
00:40:35,744 --> 00:40:38,346
No, but it would've been nice.

760
00:40:38,479 --> 00:40:40,849
I need to talk
to your supplier.

761
00:40:41,916 --> 00:40:43,484
You got a last name, <i>wasicu?</i>

762
00:40:43,618 --> 00:40:45,887
- What does that mean?
- Non-Indian person

763
00:40:46,020 --> 00:40:48,690
- who steals the fat.
- That's a first.

764
00:40:48,823 --> 00:40:50,592
What does your family think
about you being here?

765
00:40:50,725 --> 00:40:52,594
That thing with Vince.
You gotta make this go away.

766
00:40:52,727 --> 00:40:54,763
Not your mob family.
Your real family.

767
00:40:54,896 --> 00:40:57,999
DWIGHT: I haven't seen
my daughter in 18 years.

768
00:40:58,132 --> 00:41:01,335
There's nothing left for me
in New York.

